From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ethan Hill <ethan.hill1999@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:57:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] KitKat UI P33: KitKat-style launcher icon for AudioFX (P33.3)

AudioFX has no 4.4 counterpart (KitKat CyanogenMod shipped DSPManager), so the drawer entry gets a synthesized KitKat-family tile: Holo-dark gradient, three EQ faders, darker border ring, soft shadow - drawn by scripts/candyos-gen-icons.py.

Change-Id: I4bc1d3019f7fb1f4cd4679b4fd76d8ae44782744
